<view class="page">
  <view class="notice">
    公告提交后进入待审核状态，审核通过才会在公告牌中公开展示。请勿填写客户名称、证件号码、银行账号等敏感信息。
  </view>

  <view class="form-group">
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label required">公告标题</view>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{title}}"
        maxlength="40"
        placeholder="例如：求北京朝阳区长期代理记账合作"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onTitleInput"
      />
      <view class="form-tip">{{title.length}}/40 · 至少 6 个字</view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label required">公告分类</view>
      <view class="np-chips">
        <view
          class="np-chip {{category === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{categories}}"
          wx:key="value"
          data-value="{{item.value}}"
          bindtap="onCategoryTap"
        >{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label required">公告正文</view>
      <textarea
        class="form-textarea"
        value="{{content}}"
        maxlength="1000"
        placeholder="说明合作内容、服务范围、结算方式与期望的合作方式，信息越具体越容易被同行联系"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onContentInput"
      />
      <view class="form-tip">{{content.length}}/1000 · 至少 20 个字</view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">合作地区</view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{regions}}" value="{{regionIndex}}" bindchange="onRegionChange">
        <view class="picker-value">
          <text>{{regionLabel}}</text>
          <view class="arrow"></view>
        </view>
      </picker>
      <view class="form-tip">选填。不限地区会出现在任何地区的筛选结果中。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">联系方式</view>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{contact}}"
        maxlength="60"
        placeholder="选填，例如：微信 xxx / 手机号 / 邮箱"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onContactInput"
      />
      <view class="form-tip">
        选填。填写后会在详情页以打码形式展示，需对方主动点击才显示完整内容；不填写时对方可通过私信联系你。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="np-package">
    <view class="np-package-title">发布套餐</view>
    <view class="np-package-row">
      <text>{{freeText}}</text>
      <text class="np-free">默认</text>
    </view>
    <view class="np-demo">{{demoTip}}：{{paidTip}}，可在发布后于公告详情页选择。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-holder"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交审核'}}
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
